Negative control for the marker COLUMN's two states (D14).

Collapses the star to its marked pack on every row, so the column draws a full
star against every address and the one default is no longer distinguishable from
the rest — the shape of the feature with none of its meaning.

Apply from the repo root: `git apply <this file>`; revert with `git apply -R`.

Reds: the marker-column spec — the flagged row draws the FILLED star and every
other row the outlined one.

